  "goodToKnow": "Der Hebel is a lever: einen Hebel umlegen (to flip a lever), der Schalthebel (gear lever). Two idioms are very common: alle Hebel in Bewegung setzen (to pull out all the stops) and am längeren Hebel sitzen (to have the upper hand). Die Hebelwirkung is leverage, in physics and business. Archimedes' line give me a place to stand is about a Hebel. From heben (to lift). Plural: die Hebel."
